<form version="1.1" theme="dark" script="command_center.js,mitre_coverage.js" stylesheet="command_center_v2.css,mitre_coverage.css">
  <label>DEI Command Center</label><description>Telemetry intelligence and explainable detection recommendations.</description><fieldset submitButton="false" autoRun="false"></fieldset>
  <row><panel><html><div id="dei-command-center" class="dei-shell">
    <section class="dei-product-bar" aria-label="DEI workspace navigation"><div class="dei-product-brand"><span class="dei-brand-mark">DEI</span><div><strong>Detection Engineering Intelligence</strong><span>Command Center</span></div></div><nav class="dei-workspace-nav"><a class="active" href="#dei-overview">Overview</a><a href="#dei-telemetry">Telemetry</a><a href="#dei-portfolio-section">Portfolio</a><a href="#dei-coverage-section">Coverage</a><a href="#dei-mitre-section">MITRE ATT&amp;CK</a><a href="#dei-advisor-section">Detection Advisor</a></nav><div id="dei-api-status" class="dei-status">API status: checking</div></section>
    <section id="dei-overview" class="dei-hero"><div class="dei-hero-copy"><p class="dei-eyebrow">Security Operations Intelligence</p><h1>Turn telemetry into detection readiness.</h1><p class="dei-subtitle">Understand the data you have, identify what is detection-ready, and prioritize the engineering work that closes the highest-value coverage gaps.</p><div class="dei-hero-tags"><span>Telemetry intelligence</span><span>Field-aware readiness</span><span>Explainable recommendations</span><span>ES-aware</span></div></div><div class="dei-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dei-orbit dei-orbit-one"></div><div class="dei-orbit dei-orbit-two"></div><div class="dei-core-mark"><span>DEI</span><small>INTELLIGENCE</small></div></div></section>
    <section class="dei-metrics" aria-label="Detection intelligence summary"><article class="dei-metric metric-primary"><span>Observed sources</span><strong id="metric-sources">0</strong><small>active telemetry</small></article><article class="dei-metric"><span>Telemetry understanding</span><strong id="metric-understanding">0%</strong><small>mapped source types</small></article><article class="dei-metric metric-success"><span>Production ready</span><strong id="metric-ready">0</strong><small>deployable opportunities</small></article><article class="dei-metric metric-warning"><span>Partial coverage</span><strong id="metric-partial">0</strong><small>needs remediation</small></article><article class="dei-metric metric-accent"><span>Detection potential</span><strong id="metric-potential">0%</strong><small>portfolio readiness</small></article></section>
    <section id="dei-telemetry" class="dei-control-panel"><div class="dei-control-header"><div><p class="dei-eyebrow">Environment Intelligence</p><h2>Telemetry discovery</h2><p>Active source types observed across searchable indexes during the current seven-day analysis window.</p></div><span class="dei-control-note">7-day active telemetry window</span></div><div class="dei-source-frame"><div class="dei-source-frame-head"><span>Discovered source types</span><small>Read-only inventory</small></div><textarea id="dei-sources" rows="7" readonly="readonly" placeholder="Discovering active Splunk telemetry..."></textarea></div><div class="dei-actions"><label class="dei-toggle"><input id="dei-es-enabled" type="checkbox"/><span class="dei-toggle-track"></span><span>Enterprise Security enabled</span></label><button id="dei-analyze" type="button"><span>Analyze environment</span><b>→</b></button></div><p id="dei-feedback" class="dei-feedback" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
    <section id="dei-portfolio-section" class="dei-portfolio" aria-label="Detection portfolio"><div class="dei-portfolio-heading"><div><p class="dei-eyebrow">Detection Portfolio</p><h2>Readiness at a glance</h2><p>Operational view of deployable detections, remediation work, and evidence gaps.</p></div><span id="portfolio-total" class="dei-chip">0 opportunities</span></div><div class="dei-portfolio-grid"><article class="portfolio-ready"><span class="dei-dot ready"></span><div><strong id="portfolio-ready">0</strong><small>Production ready</small></div></article><article class="portfolio-partial"><span class="dei-dot partial"></span><div><strong id="portfolio-partial">0</strong><small>Partial / field gaps</small></div></article><article class="portfolio-gap"><span class="dei-dot gap"></span><div><strong id="portfolio-field-gaps">0</strong><small>Confirmed field gaps</small></div></article><article class="portfolio-unverified"><span class="dei-dot unverified"></span><div><strong id="portfolio-unverified">0</strong><small>Field unverified</small></div></article></div></section>
    <section class="dei-grid"><article id="dei-coverage-section" class="dei-panel dei-coverage-panel"><div class="dei-section-heading"><div><p class="dei-eyebrow">Telemetry DNA</p><h2>Coverage profile</h2><p>Detection opportunity distribution across understood telemetry domains.</p></div><span id="coverage-label" class="dei-chip">Not analyzed</span></div><div class="dei-ring-wrap"><div id="coverage-ring" class="dei-ring"><span id="coverage-value">0%</span><small>potential</small></div><div id="coverage-domains" class="dei-domain-list"></div></div></article><article id="dei-advisor-section" class="dei-panel dei-advisor-panel"><div class="dei-section-heading"><div><p class="dei-eyebrow">Detection Advisor</p><h2>Prioritized opportunities</h2><p>Click a detection finding to inspect its ATT&amp;CK coverage and protection outcome.</p></div><span id="recommendation-count" class="dei-chip">0 results</span></div><div id="recommendations" class="dei-recommendations"><p class="dei-empty">Run an analysis to generate recommendations.</p></div></article></section>
    <section id="dei-mitre-section" class="dei-mitre-workspace"><div class="dei-section-heading"><div><p class="dei-eyebrow">MITRE ATT&amp;CK Coverage</p><h2>Detection effectiveness map</h2><p>Choose a detection finding to see where it provides visibility across the Enterprise ATT&amp;CK tactical lifecycle.</p></div><span id="mitre-selection" class="dei-chip">No detection selected</span></div><div id="mitre-swimlane" class="dei-mitre-swimlane" aria-label="MITRE ATT&amp;CK tactic swimlane"></div><div class="dei-protection-grid"><article class="dei-protection-card"><span class="dei-protection-label">What this detection protects</span><h3 id="protection-title">Select a detection finding</h3><p id="protection-summary">The protection narrative will explain the adversary behavior, security boundary, and operational risk addressed by the selected detection.</p><div id="protection-techniques" class="dei-techniques"></div></article><article class="dei-protection-card"><span class="dei-protection-label">Security outcome</span><div id="protection-outcomes" class="dei-protection-outcomes"><p class="dei-empty">Run analysis and select a detection to populate protection outcomes.</p></div></article></div></section>
  </div></html></panel></row>
</form>
